{"seq":1,"slug":"mathematical-foundations-of-quantum-mechanics","title":"《量子力学的数学基础》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/other-major-works/mathematical-foundations-of-quantum-mechanics","wordCount":1706,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"量子力学的数学基础\">《量子力学的数学基础》</h1><p>《量子力学的数学基础》（Mathematische Grundlagen der Quantenmechanik）是冯·诺依曼1932年由施普林格出版的德文专著。当时量子力学已由海森堡的矩阵力学与薛定谔的波动力学各立门户、彼此似乎对立，冯·诺依曼用希尔伯特空间与算子理论给出了统一而严格的数学框架，并第一次把&quot;测量&quot;纳入理论本身。本篇聚焦这部<strong>物理-数学著作</strong>——它解决了什么数学危机、引入了哪些工具（希尔伯特空间、自伴算子、密度矩阵、投影测量）、以及它著名的&quot;测量公设&quot;与隐变量论断。它与冯·诺依曼其他数学贡献的关系见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/a-universal-genius/quantum-mechanics-and-beyond\">量子力学及其他</a>。本章另一篇 <a href=\"the-computer-and-the-brain\">《计算机与人脑》</a> 讨论他晚年的计算著作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这部著作解决的问题可以概括为一个数学危机：两套看似对立的量子力学，缺一个统一而严格的地基。它的核心由三组工具构成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>数学对象</th>\n<th>在物理中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>希尔伯特空间</td>\n<td>完备内积空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0097em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>状态 = 单位向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vert\\psi\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自伴算子</td>\n<td>空间上的算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 及其谱</td>\n<td>可观测量、可能测量值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密度矩阵</td>\n<td>加权纯态的混合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>统计混合态、冯·诺依曼熵</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>统一的方式</strong>：矩阵力学与波动力学只是同一抽象算子在不同基下的表示，等价性由此立刻显然。</li>\n<li><strong>两点须分开看</strong>：数学部分（希尔伯特空间表述、谱定理）无懈可击；测量公设与隐变量论断涉及未被证立的物理—哲学假设。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"时代背景-两种量子力学的对立\">时代背景：两种量子力学的对立</h2><p>1925—1926年，量子力学几乎同时以两种形式出现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>提出者</th>\n<th>数学对象</th>\n<th>直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矩阵力学</td>\n<td>海森堡、玻恩、约当</td>\n<td>无穷维矩阵</td>\n<td>离散、代数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波动力学</td>\n<td>薛定谔</td>\n<td>波函数、微分方程</td>\n<td>连续、解析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两者给出相同的物理预测，却看似毫不相干，且都依赖狄拉克&quot;δ函数&quot;等当时<strong>数学上不严格</strong>的工具。物理学界缺一个统一、严密的地基。冯·诺依曼正是来填这个坑的——他要回答：&quot;量子力学到底在数学上是什么？&quot;</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心工具-希尔伯特空间与自伴算子\">核心工具：希尔伯特空间与自伴算子</h2><p>冯·诺依曼的关键洞见是：两种力学其实是同一个抽象空间——<strong>希尔伯特空间</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0097em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>（完备的内积空间）——上的两种表象。物理状态是空间中的单位向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\psi\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>，物理量（可观测量）是空间上的<strong>自伴算子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A|\\psi_n\\rangle = a_n |\\psi_n\\rangle,\\qquad \\langle A\\rangle = \\langle\\psi|A|\\psi\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>测量值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必是自伴算子的实特征值，期望值由内积给出。这一框架的威力在于：矩阵力学与波动力学只是同一抽象算子在不同基下的具体表示，二者的等价性立刻显然。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  H[&quot;希尔伯特空间 H&quot;] --&gt; ST[&quot;状态 = 单位向量 |ψ⟩&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; OB[&quot;可观测量 = 自伴算子 A&quot;]&#10;  OB --&gt; SP[&quot;谱定理: A 的实特征值即可能测量值&quot;]&#10;  ST --&gt; DM[&quot;混合态 = 密度矩阵 ρ&quot;]&#10;  SP --&gt; ME[&quot;测量公设&quot;]&#10;  DM --&gt; ME\">flowchart TD\n  H[\"希尔伯特空间 H\"] --&gt; ST[\"状态 = 单位向量 |ψ⟩\"]\n  H --&gt; OB[\"可观测量 = 自伴算子 A\"]\n  OB --&gt; SP[\"谱定理: A 的实特征值即可能测量值\"]\n  ST --&gt; DM[\"混合态 = 密度矩阵 ρ\"]\n  SP --&gt; ME[\"测量公设\"]\n  DM --&gt; ME</pre><p>为严格处理连续谱，冯·诺依曼系统发展了无界自伴算子的<strong>谱定理</strong>——这本身是泛函分析的一项重大数学成果，影响远超物理学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"密度矩阵与冯-诺依曼熵\">密度矩阵与冯·诺依曼熵</h2><p>为描述&quot;统计混合态&quot;（系统以一定概率处于若干纯态），冯·诺依曼引入了<strong>密度矩阵</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>，并定义了量子版本的熵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(\\rho) = -\\operatorname{tr}(\\rho \\ln \\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">tr</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是&quot;冯·诺依曼熵&quot;。它今天是量子信息论的核心量——纠缠、量子信道容量、量子纠错都建立其上。一部1932年的物理奠基之作，竟为半个多世纪后才兴起的量子计算提供了基本语言，足见其数学的前瞻性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测量公设与隐变量论断\">测量公设与隐变量论断</h2><p>全书最具哲学张力的部分是对<strong>测量</strong>的处理。冯·诺依曼明确区分了两类演化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过程</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过程2（薛定谔演化）</td>\n<td>孤立系统按方程连续幺正演化</td>\n<td>确定、可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过程1（测量坍缩）</td>\n<td>测量使态投影到某特征态</td>\n<td>随机、不可逆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>他还给出了著名的&quot;不可能性证明&quot;：论断不存在能重现量子预测的隐变量理论。这一论断影响了三十年的物理学共识，但后来被贝尔（1966年）批评其前提（对隐变量取期望的线性假设）过强，玻姆1952年的导波理论已是反例。</p>\n<p>这里要点明一个反模式：<strong>不能把数学严谨等同于哲学定论</strong>。冯·诺依曼的框架在数学上无懈可击，但其测量公设引入的&quot;主观坍缩&quot;和隐变量论断都涉及未被证立的物理-哲学假设。后世的争论恰恰发生在这些假设上，而非数学上。这部著作的伟大在于它划清了&quot;哪部分是严格数学、哪部分是物理诠释&quot;，从而让争论得以精确进行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"历史地位与权衡\">历史地位与权衡</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>贡献</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数学</td>\n<td>希尔伯特空间表述、谱定理，奠定数学物理范式</td>\n<td>抽象度高，物理学家初期难接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理</td>\n<td>统一两种力学、形式化测量</td>\n<td>测量公设留下&quot;测量问题&quot;至今未决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后续影响</td>\n<td>密度矩阵、冯·诺依曼熵成为量子信息基础</td>\n<td>隐变量论断被证明前提过强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>公允地说，这部著作是数学家为物理学立法的典范：它不发明新物理，而是为既有物理提供了一个严格、统一、可推理的数学地基——这正是冯·诺依曼横跨数学与物理之非凡才能的集中体现，相关侧写见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/a-universal-genius/quantum-mechanics-and-beyond\">量子力学及其他</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>《量子力学的数学基础》(1932) 是冯·诺依曼为量子力学立法的德文专著，用希尔伯特空间统一了矩阵力学与波动力学。</li>\n<li>其核心工具是希尔伯特空间、自伴算子与谱定理，物理状态与可观测量由此获得严格的数学对应。</li>\n<li>他引入密度矩阵与冯·诺依曼熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=-\\operatorname{tr}(\\rho\\ln\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">tr</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，成为半个世纪后量子信息论的基本语言。</li>\n<li>关于测量的&quot;过程1/过程2&quot;区分形式化了坍缩问题；其隐变量不可能性证明的前提后被贝尔批评为过强。</li>\n<li>要点在于区分它的两半：数学部分无懈可击，测量公设与隐变量论断则涉及未被证立的物理—哲学假设。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"the-computer-and-the-brain\">《计算机与人脑》</a> — 冯·诺依曼晚年的计算与智能著作</li>\n<li>核心贡献：<a href=\"../../core-contributions/a-universal-genius/contributions-to-mathematics\">对数学的贡献</a></li>\n<li>生平：<a href=\"../../life-and-times/to-america/princeton-and-the-institute\">普林斯顿与高等研究院</a></li>\n<li>来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematical_Foundations_of_Quantum_Mechanics\">Mathematical Foundations of Quantum Mechanics — Wikipedia</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"《量子力学的数学基础》","id":"量子力学的数学基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时代背景：两种量子力学的对立","id":"时代背景-两种量子力学的对立"},{"level":2,"text":"核心工具：希尔伯特空间与自伴算子","id":"核心工具-希尔伯特空间与自伴算子"},{"level":2,"text":"密度矩阵与冯·诺依曼熵","id":"密度矩阵与冯-诺依曼熵"},{"level":2,"text":"测量公设与隐变量论断","id":"测量公设与隐变量论断"},{"level":2,"text":"历史地位与权衡","id":"历史地位与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"一门新的科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/theory-of-games/a-new-science"},"next":{"title":"《计算机与人脑》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/other-major-works/the-computer-and-the-brain"}}